  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Clean Up Georgia Phase II (EcoVision)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Clean Up Georgia Phase II (EcoVision)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r projektet Clean Up Georgia fas II &#xe4;r att   f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra avfallshanteringen i landet genom kampanjer Society         Awareness, inf&#xf6;ra 3R (Reduce, Reuse, Recycle) system och moderna      metoder.                                                               Genomf&#xf6;rare &#xe4;r tre civila samh&#xe4;llets organisationer: Greens Movement of Georgia(3 MSEK),GNSE &quot;Orchis&quot;(3,5 MSEK),Eco-Vision (1.9 MSEK).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project Clean Up Georgia Phase II is to       challenge waste management in the country through Society Awareness   Campaigns, introducing 3R (Reduce, Reuse, Recycle) systems and Modern methods.The implementing partners are three civil society             organizations: Greens Movement of Georgia(3 MSEK), Georgian Society   of Nature Explorers &quot;Orchis&quot;(3.5 MSEK),Eco-Vision (1.9. MSEK).</narrative>
  </description>
